## Process

1. **Uncover Opportunities** — Behavioural research and technical constraint analysis relevant to the product category.
2. **Informed Ideation** — Structured creativity to produce a range of viable, engineering-led design directions.
3. **Get Real, Fast** — Detailed form development and high-fidelity prototypes for real-world evaluation.
4. **Ready to Ship** — Finalised documentation package and factory-floor liaison for consistent outcomes.